---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

---
<BaseLayout>
	<main class="p-4 m-auto w-full md:w-8/12 lg:w-7/12 xl:w-4/12 prose">
		<h1>Open Shadowdark</h1>
		<p>
			Open Shadowdark is an attempt to collect all of the first and third party
			content for <a href="https://www.thearcanelibrary.com/pages/shadowdark">Shadowdark RPG</a>
			which has been released under an Open License. Whether that is the
			Shadowdark RPG Third-Party License, or a Creative Commons license, or any
			other license that allows you to use the works without payment to the
			original author.
		</p>
		<h2>Where is ...?</h2>
		<p>
			If you know of or have created a shadowdark project which releases some
			or all of their content under an open license and it isn't listed here,
			please get in touch at
			<a href="mailto:contact@chaoticwizard.com">contact@chaoticwizard.com</a>.
		</p>
	</main>
</BaseLayout>
